"automatic, grid, focus and speaker layouts, show or hide the participant "
"panel, pin important participants, cycle your self-view between tile, "
"picture-in-picture and hidden, or switch to compact mode when you want the "
"call to stay visible while you keep working in chat. Larger calls "
"automatically use a denser grid while focus and speaker layouts keep a "
"filmstrip for the remaining participants."
msgstr ""
"Inside the conference window, use the layout buttons to switch between "
"automatic, grid, focus and speaker layouts, show or hide the participant "
